&lt;p&gt;We are actively looking for an experienced front-end engineer to join our Web Platform team. As a vital member of the team, you will be the architect, designer, and developer across a broad range of high-impact projects. You will act as a force multiplier, partnering closely with &lt;strong&gt;8+ product teams&lt;/strong&gt; to help build and scale a robust web-based platform that supports a suite of connected devices for enterprise customers at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will go beyond building features; you will be instrumental in modernizing a massive codebase through &lt;strong&gt;microfrontend re-architecture&lt;/strong&gt; and pioneering &lt;strong&gt;AI enablement&lt;/strong&gt; across all of web engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate architectural evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute and scale our ongoing microfrontend transition across a massive, complex codebase to ensure high modularity, scalability, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower product engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Support, collaborate with, and mentor engineers across 8+ distinct product teams, ensuring they have the platform tools needed to move fast and build great user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion the adoption and integration of AI tools and methodologies to accelerate development and enhance the capabilities of all web engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate the stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously evaluate, select, and design the architecture using next-generation web technologies and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own developer infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and optimize our &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; to streamline deployments, reduce friction, and improve developer velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion testing and quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish, advocate for, and enforce rigorous automated testing standards and quality assurance practices across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen platform foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop shared core utilities, infrastructure libraries, and architectural patterns that enable fellow teammates to build faster, while collaborating seamlessly with our dedicated Design System team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of relevant industry experience in front-end or platform web development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise&lt;/strong&gt; working with modern web technologies such as React, TypeScript, Webpack, Vite, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record&lt;/strong&gt; of building complex single-page applications (SPAs) and hands-on experience designing or implementing &lt;strong&gt;microfrontend architectures&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience configuring, optimizing, and maintaining &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, CircleCI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong background in establishing robust automated testing strategies (unit, integration, end-to-end) and driving overall code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward-thinking mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with or a strong interest in AI-assisted development and integrating AI into engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or a similar technical field of study.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Employee Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is committed to fostering a workplace environment that prioritizes the holistic health and wellbeing of our employees and their families by offering comprehensive wellness perks, benefits, and resources. Our benefits and perks programs include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare programs that can be tailored to meet the personal health and financial well-being needs - Premiums are 100% covered for the employee under at least one plan and 80% for family premiums under all plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nationwide medical, vision and dental coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Saving Account (HSA) with annual employer contributions and Flexible Spending Account (FSA) with tax saving options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanded mental health support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave policy &amp;amp; fertility benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to relax and recharge through our paid holidays, firmwide extended holidays, flexible PTO and personal sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness/fitness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy lunches provided daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do sponsor and take over sponsorship of employment visas for this role. If we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;C9DxTc &quot;&gt;Annual Pay Range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
