&lt;p data-start=&quot;102&quot; data-end=&quot;411&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;102&quot; data-end=&quot;129&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;147&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;Speech Language Pathologists (SLP)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our teams, providing home health visits throughout New Hampshire. You’ll be working with adult and geriatric clients in the place they feel most comfortable—their homes.&lt;/p&gt;
