&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The CX Outbound Engagement Voice Team designs,&amp;nbsp;operates, and evolves the high-scale voice infrastructure behind&amp;nbsp;NiCE&amp;nbsp;outbound engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
