&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company and a proud Great Place to Work® Certified employer in the United States.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Human Resources Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt; on the &lt;strong&gt;Global People Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in our &lt;strong&gt;New York City&lt;/strong&gt; office, you will align with several business units across the globe to give our employees and leaders the tools and knowledge necessary for them to succeed at Taboola.&lt;/p&gt;
